Portions of `crates/duthub-sandbox/src/windows/` are derived from the
openai/codex project, `codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs`:
  https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/main/codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs
  Copyright OpenAI and contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Derived files (each carries a header naming this provenance):
  src/windows/identity.rs       (identity.rs, setup.rs)
  src/windows/dpapi.rs          (dpapi.rs)
  src/windows/token.rs          (token.rs, cap.rs)
  src/windows/deny_read_acl.rs  (deny_read_acl.rs)
  src/windows/no_reparse_dir.rs (no_reparse_dir.rs)
  src/windows/process.rs        (process.rs — process creation and stdio plumbing)

Changes made by duthub: the AppContainer cell policy, the per-DUT capability
store moved out of the writable cell, `SandboxError`-based fail-closed error
handling, and the `status()` capability probe. duthub does not vendor or run
Codex itself; only these mechanisms were ported.

